# Step 0 - Keep only reproducible source and synthetic inputs in version control.
# - Exclude populated .env files because they may contain provider or signing keys.
# - Keep .env.example so a recipient can see every supported configuration name.
# - Exclude virtual environments, Python/notebook caches, and generated SQLite reports.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
data/local/
